					<![CDATA[
						 <p>A bit tarnished by the lack of Brass's viewpoint. Seeing through the Misters' eyes is what makes this series intriguing most of all.<br /> But I suppose it's a different take, and with Mr. Redd physically showing up, it's clear that we're reaching the finale.</p> <p>Seriously, though, need to stop shoehorning puns in here. Puns ought to be honktraband.</p> 
				 	]]>
